  "system": {
    "identifier": "shoton-crystal-release-crystal-rabbit",
    "description": "<p>You manifest a beast made of crystal. By molding your crystal release chakra, you are able to conjure two crystal rabbits. Crystal Rabbits are Earthen Artifacts.</p>\n<p>The Crystal Rabbits has the listed statistics found at the end of this clan on its stat block. It uses your highest jutsu attack bonus or Save DC when an effect calls for it.</p>\n<p>You can command them as a Bonus action, and all rabbits attempt to perform the same actions against either the same creature or different creatures determined by you.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the number of Rabbits you Summon by +1.</p>",
